      "content": "thanks, that's exactly the tone they're looking for. i just worry about how the critics will react though. if we present it this way, people are definitely going to bring up the idea that we're just being \"colonialist\" or that we're ignoring the rights of the original cultures. \n\nhow should we address those arguments in the policy? do we just admit that the repatriation movement is mostly just political sentiment rather than a real concern for the objects themselves?",
